@title Mega Man Zero 3 (USA)
@file Megaman Zero 3 (U).gba
@game BZ3E
@chip SRAM
@status wip: reaches the snowfield scene after the opening story crawl ("Two months later...", the Resistance soldiers and Ciel with Zero, dialogue still running); nothing is saved on New Game. The first save is at the Resistance Base after the opening mission (the crashed-ship stage and its boss), which needs real platforming and combat. A human should record: NEW GAME, hold A through the story, play the opening mission, then save at the base computer and quit after the save message. [load]: LOAD GAME > the slot > the base.

# The story crawl only advances while a button is held.

[new]
wait 600
press START after=60
checkpoint title window=0 compare=text
press START after=90
checkpoint title_menu window=10
# NEW GAME
press START
until blank timeout=600 every=4
until notblank timeout=900 every=4
wait 60
hold A
until blank timeout=9000 every=10
release
until notblank timeout=1200 every=4
wait 60
checkpoint two_months window=10
mash A until blank timeout=4000 every=30
until notblank timeout=900 every=4
wait 3000
checkpoint snowfield window=10
